Deployment freeze: period when production deployments restricted (holidays, major events, compliance requirements). Reasons: reduced support availability, high traffic periods (Black Friday), regulatory change windows. Management: 1) Calendar-based gates in pipeline, 2) Emergency hotfix process, 3) Communication, 4) Extended staging validation. Implementation:
# Deployment calendar (deployment-calendar.json)
{
  "freezePeriods": [
    {
      "name": "Holiday Freeze 2024",
      "start": "2024-12-23T00:00:00Z",
      "end": "2025-01-02T00:00:00Z",
      "reason": "Reduced support staff availability",
      "allowHotfixes": true
    },
    {
      "name": "Black Friday",
      "start": "2024-11-29T00:00:00Z",
      "end": "2024-12-02T00:00:00Z",
      "reason": "High traffic event",
      "allowHotfixes": true
    }
  ]
}

Pipeline enforcement:
stage('Check Deployment Freeze') {
  steps {
    script {
      def calendar = readJSON(file: 'deployment-calendar.json')
      def now = new Date()
      def inFreeze = calendar.freezePeriods.any { freeze ->
        Date start = Date.parse("yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ss'Z'", freeze.start)
        Date end = Date.parse("yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ss'Z'", freeze.end)
        return now >= start && now <= end
      }

      if (inFreeze) {
        def freeze = calendar.freezePeriods.find { /* current freeze */ }

        if (env.DEPLOYMENT_TYPE == 'HOTFIX' && freeze.allowHotfixes) {
          echo "Hotfix deployment allowed during freeze: ${freeze.name}"
          input(
            message: "HOTFIX during freeze: ${freeze.reason}. Approve?",
            submitter: 'production-approvers',
            parameters: [
              text(name: 'JUSTIFICATION', description: 'Hotfix justification'),
              string(name: 'INCIDENT_TICKET', description: 'Incident ticket number')
            ]
          )
        } else {
          error("""
            Deployment blocked: ${freeze.name}
            Reason: ${freeze.reason}
            End time: ${freeze.end}
            For hotfixes, set DEPLOYMENT_TYPE=HOTFIX
          """)
        }
      }
    }
  }
}

Hotfix process during freeze:
1. Create hotfix branch from production tag
2. Minimal change (bug fix only)
3. Expedited review (2 approvers minimum)
4. Set DEPLOYMENT_TYPE=HOTFIX parameter
5. Additional approval gate with justification
6. Deploy
7. Enhanced monitoring
8. Incident report documenting freeze override

